<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 52 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/W .7>>/DA(0.121569 0.168627 0.247059 rg /Helv 7.5 Tf)/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<</BC[.792157 .843137 .92549]/BG[.952941 .964706 .980392]>>/MaxLen 100/P 30 0 R/Rect[54 281.88978 541.2756 335.8898]/T(f06)/TU(Boundary)/V(Each class exposes only methods, like add_book\(\), is_available\(\), is_member\(\), borrow\(\), return_book\(\) and overdue_list\(\). The data \(the _books, _students and _loans dictionaries\) is hidden inside each class with an underscore, and the limits \(MAX_BOOKS, LOAN_DAYS\) are only used inside LoanManager.)>>
endobj

