26 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 53 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/W .7>>/DA(0.121569 0.168627 0.247059 rg /Helv 7.5 Tf)/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<</BC[.792157 .843137 .92549]/BG[.952941 .964706 .980392]>>/MaxLen 100/P 30 0 R/Rect[54 173.88977 541.2756 227.88977]/T(f07)/TU(Cohesion)/V(Everything in LoanManager is about the borrowing rules: borrow, return and overdue all change only if the school changes its loan policy \(e.g. 21 days instead of 14\). Catalog only changes if we store more info about books, and Members only if we store more info about students, so each module has one reason to change.)>>
