29 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/AP<</N 54 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/W .7>>/DA(0.121569 0.168627 0.247059 rg /Helv 7.5 Tf)/DV()/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<</BC[.792157 .843137 .92549]/BG[.952941 .964706 .980392]>>/MaxLen 100/P 30 0 R/Rect[54 65.88977 541.2756 119.88977]/T(f08)/TU(Coupling)/V(LibraryMenu -> LoanManager, Catalog, Members.   LoanManager -> Catalog, Members.   Catalog and Members depend on nothing. To keep it weak, modules only call each other's public methods \(never the dictionaries\), and objects are passed in through the constructor, so I can swap Catalog for a database later without touching LoanManager.)>>
endobj

